{
  "title": "Default Arguments & Flexibility",
  "subtitle": "Making Parameters Optional with Fallbacks",
  "topic": "6.1 • DEFAULT ARGUMENTS",
  "body": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px; width: 100%;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #111111; padding: 4px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\n      6.1 • Flexible Parameters\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      Default <hlt>Arguments</hlt>\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #222222; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 640px;\">\n      Default arguments allow functions to work without requiring every parameter to be explicitly passed by the caller.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background: #86efac; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #111111; border-radius: 4px; padding: 20px;\">\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111111; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n      Real-World Example: Tax Calculator\n    </span>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 10px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      Standard Rate with Custom Overrides\n    </h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.5;\">\n      In an e-commerce shop, standard sales tax might be 5% (0.05). Customers in special zones can pass a different rate:\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"background: #0d1117; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #111111; padding: 14px; font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; color: #f0f6fc; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 4px;\">\n      <span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">def</span> <span style=\"color: #d2a8ff;\">calculate_total</span>(price, tax_rate=<span style=\"color: #7ee787;\">0.05</span>):<br/>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">return</span> price + (price * tax_rate)<br/><br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(calculate_total(<span style=\"color: #7ee787;\">100</span>))        <span style=\"color: #8b949e;\"># Uses default 0.05 -> 105.0</span><br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(calculate_total(<span style=\"color: #7ee787;\">100</span>, <span style=\"color: #7ee787;\">0.10</span>))  <span style=\"color: #8b949e;\"># Custom 10% override -> 110.0</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
}